  "duration_s": 92.250998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你酒量挺好的呀，领导您可抬举我了，我平时这么太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导菜虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。不，李，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾。多这杯酒，我先敬您领喝哥就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病。小李啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路，走哪儿还还得听领导指挥吗？来，这么晚，只能吃剩菜了吧。领导饭在哪我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了，个就来带什么礼物，哇，都不是外人。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀。哈哈哈哈，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。哈哈哈啊啊，关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1470,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1890,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "领导您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3590,
      "end_ms": 4830,
      "text": "我平时这么太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5050,
      "end_ms": 6750,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6770,
      "end_ms": 7350,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7370,
      "end_ms": 8850,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10130,
      "end_ms": 11490,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12210,
      "end_ms": 14030,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14030,
      "end_ms": 15750,
      "text": "领导菜虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15950,
      "end_ms": 17370,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00011",
      "start_ms": 19830,
      "end_ms": 19950,
      "text": "不，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19950,
      "end_ms": 20190,
      "text": "李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20610,
      "end_ms": 22350,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23310,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24810,
      "end_ms": 26310,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00016",
      "start_ms": 26310,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00017",
      "start_ms": 27210,
      "end_ms": 32440,
      "text": "我先敬您领喝哥就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32440,
      "end_ms": 33220,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33220,
      "end_ms": 34420,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00020",
      "start_ms": 34920,
      "end_ms": 35920,
      "text": "我是看不起病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00021",
      "start_ms": 39420,
      "end_ms": 40060,
      "text": "小李啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40360,
      "end_ms": 41980,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41980,
      "end_ms": 43000,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00024",
      "start_ms": 43300,
      "end_ms": 44900,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00025",
      "start_ms": 45080,
      "end_ms": 47020,
      "text": "走哪儿还还得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48520,
      "end_ms": 48700,
      "text": "来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00027",
      "start_ms": 48700,
      "end_ms": 49180,
      "text": "这么晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00028",
      "start_ms": 49380,
      "end_ms": 50560,
      "text": "只能吃剩菜了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50880,
      "end_ms": 52620,
      "text": "领导饭在哪我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52800,
      "end_ms": 54760,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00031",
      "start_ms": 54760,
      "end_ms": 56260,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00032",
      "start_ms": 58500,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "个就来带什么礼物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60030,
      "end_ms": 60205,
      "text": "哇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60370,
      "end_ms": 61085,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00035",
      "start_ms": 61510,
      "end_ms": 61890,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00036",
      "start_ms": 62110,
      "end_ms": 62730,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00037",
      "start_ms": 62730,
      "end_ms": 63310,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00038",
      "start_ms": 63450,
      "end_ms": 64730,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00039",
      "start_ms": 64790,
      "end_ms": 67105,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00040",
      "start_ms": 68830,
      "end_ms": 70135,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00041",
      "start_ms": 70570,
      "end_ms": 72015,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00042",
      "start_ms": 72370,
      "end_ms": 73515,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00043",
      "start_ms": 73740,
      "end_ms": 75095,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00044",
      "start_ms": 76710,
      "end_ms": 77465,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00045",
      "start_ms": 77810,
      "end_ms": 78935,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00046",
      "start_ms": 79940,
      "end_ms": 81940,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00047",
      "start_ms": 81940,
      "end_ms": 84335,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00048",
      "start_ms": 85900,
      "end_ms": 87340,
      "text": "哈哈哈啊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00049",
      "start_ms": 87540,
      "end_ms": 88100,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00050",
      "start_ms": 88260,
      "end_ms": 89400,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00051",
      "start_ms": 89400,
      "end_ms": 90105,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cb04492a54362efd_s00052",
      "start_ms": 90430,
      "end_ms": 92045,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
